---
description: Client-side-only conversion and privacy
globs: src/components/tools/**,src/lib/converters/**
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never upload user files to a server for conversion.
- State clearly: "Your file never leaves your device."
- Load heavy libraries (pdf.js, ag-psd, heic2any, three) only via dynamic `import()` after user action.
- Do not add server endpoints that accept file bodies.
